Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they've understood me better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking at Hierophant Green\Nwas a revelation for Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make Hierophant Green invisible\Nto everyone like it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use its invisibility\Nto my advantage and reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's secret before\Nfinishing him off for good.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.35,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the moment that it's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the moment that we're\Ngoing to continue to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to continue to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first one of those who are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the end of the\Nworld. End of the world?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.64,0:04:14.94,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,689)\pos(132,889.999)}Episode 46: Dio's World, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truck is completely totaled. Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense the old man and\NDio racing across the rooftops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only dealt with\NKakyoin and Joseph so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're attempting to\Nstrike from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means Jotaro and Polnareff must be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waiting in the wings to\Nattack me from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin's Hierophant Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He turned it into a web?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've laid that up?\NThat's right. Anything that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,touches this web is instantly fired upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're surrounded for 20\Nmeters on all sides you're done dio
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've snared you in your stand\NAnd i can sense your every move?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 meter radius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my stand, I have the\Nability to rule the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you do in the face of such\Noverwhelming power all right here it comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold
