Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What got you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went flying through the\Nair like a rag doll, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he really hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even move a single finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't speak either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been a fatal blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 5:15, which means it's\Nmidnight back in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what mom and\Ndad are doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing them, I'm sure\Nthey're sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite his brief moment of reflection,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriyaki Kakuin's last thoughts\Nwere not of his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mind shifted and homed in on the\Nquestion weighing heaviest on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to find an answer\Nbefore nothingness took hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be able to instantly sense any\Nmovement within Hierophant Green's web.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow, Dio managed to destroy\Nthe entire web in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't one strand at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was instantaneous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a split second difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he shatter a 20 meter\Nradius area all at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
