Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this! Hermit! Purp off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're next on the chopping block, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for Jonathan's body\Nto become mine completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must drink the blood of a Joestar,!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I think now's as good a\Ntime as any to partake. Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he destroy them all without\Nthe slightest delay in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something as outlandish as\Nthat doesn't seem possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no other explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to know the truth\Nbehind such a terrifying ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't tell Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar what I've learned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The friends I've come to\Nlove are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking that body back in\Nthe name of Granny Erina! Erina?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean that backwater shrew?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drink your blood,\Nthen eliminate you vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Joseph Joestar, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my final Emerald Splash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why that attack was utterly pointless?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you're now just a dying\Nhero longing to make his mark on the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if Kakyoin wouldn't waste the time he\Nhas left with some meaningless attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he go after the clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it some kind of sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he trained to tell me something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the strength\Nto give you another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you have to decipher it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let the others know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriaki Kakyoin has died.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.64,SC46 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(118.001,584)\fad(170,0)}Noriaki Kakyoin...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.64,0:11:09.35,SC46 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(118.001,584)}Noriaki Kakyoin... has died
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple, now take\Nthis among the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You old fool, out of all the stands\NI've seen, yours is the weakest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, why did you\Ndestroy the clock earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you were trying to send\Nme a message, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how does it relate to the clock tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Dio's closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be it, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you figure out the secret of his\Nstand's ability in your dying moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroy the clock with Emerald Splash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you aimed for the hands\Nwhich stopped the clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio Stan the world has the power to\Nstop time whenever Dio commands it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 meter radius.
