Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now witness the power of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've caused time to stop for you, which\Nmeans you won't see or feel any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die! Cock fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even realize\Nyou're about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't know what happened\Nhere, only that you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand now, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you were trying\Nto tell me in your message!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.48,0:13:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna waste this chance!
