Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freezing time is bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Dio being able to move\Naround too is a deadly combo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable, we might\Nnot have what it takes to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beat it just calm down\Ncalm down and think i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know the meaning of the\Nword panic there has to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be a way to beat him and\Nif anyone can find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna hit me, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or don't you care about\Ndrinking my blood anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're running Hormone through\Nyour body to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've wrapped your\Nbody with Hermit Purple,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've infused it with Hamon,\Nlike a cloak of high-voltage wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A geriatric genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems I'm not\Nthe only clever one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been using this little\Ntrick to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thanks to Kakyoin's message, I've\Nlearned something about your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, you can bring time to a standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a limit to\Nthe amount of time you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can use that power only\Nthree to four seconds. I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say if you could do it\Nfor a longer period than
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that instead Of chasing us\Naround town all night you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would have wiped us all\Nout back at the Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tracking us down tells me\Neverything that I need to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know so you Finally figured\Nit out that's an impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accomplishment congratulations\NCongratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should congratulate Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave his life to give\Nus a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to care?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you\Nknow my Stan's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can your pathetic\NHormone do against my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple and Hormone! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can kill you with or without\Ngoing through your Hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of it raining\Nmen, but never old geezers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what if he's Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell were you doing on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spying on the pretty girls below?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay far away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's staying outside\Nof my Stan's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Joseph goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, Stan, the world gives him\Nthe ability to control time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, stay out of its wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once more, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I began using this power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only able to freeze\Ntime for the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, as my neck began\Nthe process of healing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found that I could stop time\Nfor two seconds and even three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can stop time for five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time is stopped, so from my perspective,\Nit only feels like five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll be able to\Nstop time for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then an hour, and later,\Nas long as I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have the ability to stop\Ntime to my heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's covered himself with\NHamon for protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago, Hamon was a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, thanks to the world, it's\Nlittle more than an irritation.
