Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:19:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man run away you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get out of here Joe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dario, don't even try to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay far away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he's joining Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff must be hiding\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're next, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you still want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear pig-headedness\Nruns in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How ungrateful can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're blatantly ignoring\Nyour grandfather's wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after he gave his life to tell\Nyou about the power of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely his pathetic pleas\Nwarranted a bit of consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to move closer if I want to\Nbeat your sorry ass to a pulp. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By all means, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to be faster my stand\Nis more powerful than any other even
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without the world's tremendous power\Nand speed it would still outclass
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your pitiful star platinum your stand\Nhas a lot in common with my star
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,platinum we're not long-range\Nfighters but we have incredible power
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always had a desire to see how much
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stronger the world is\Ncompared with Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems pointless\Nto compare them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you did was give me\Na love tap on the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you ripped my 20,000 yen pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the life of me, I can't figure out\Nwhy you Joestars are so stubborn. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall accept your cheap provocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let our comparison resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moulde!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comparing our punching speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moulde, muda, muda...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moulde, muda, muda!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.38,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been six months since I began\Nto grasp the art of stopping time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for a moment, it looked as\Nthough time itself had stood still.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.34,0:23:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world grind to a halt!
